  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevent and Mitigate the Impact of Transboundary Zoonotic Diseases of Pandemic Potential thr...</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(1) enhancing existing systems for data collection, analysis, visualization, risk assessment capabilities and reporting on emerging transboundary animal and plant pests and diseases (APPDs), including zoonotic diseases at the human-animal- plant-environment (HAPE) interface;
(2) improve national and community level biosecurity capacities and systems through the implementation of FAO Progressive Management Pathway for Terestrial Animal Biosecurity (PMP-TAB)</narrative>
  </description>
